OL,3,GNEWSAEasyJet to axe jobs ahead of
OL,4,A#5.7bn takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FEasyJet has confirmed plans to cut head
OL,7,Foffice jobs ahead of its #5.7bn private
OL,8,Fequity takeover.
OL,10,FThe low-cost Luton-based carrier is
OL,11,Funderstood to be consulting on
OL,12,Fproposals that could see up to about 50
OL,13,Fhead office roles axed out of a
OL,14,F2,300-strong team.
OL,16,FIt came after EasyJet agreed in July to
OL,17,Fa takeover for 715p a share by US firm
OL,18,FApollo, which also owns Wagamama's
OL,19,Fparent company The Restaurant Group.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
