OL,3,GNEWSAEasyJet to axe jobs ahead of
OL,4,A#5.7bn takeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FShareholders are voting on the deal on
OL,7,FWednesday and, if approved, it is
OL,8,Fexpected to complete in the first
OL,9,Fquarter of 2027. It is understood that
OL,10,Fthe job cuts are not linked to Apollo
OL,11,For the takeover.
